Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:21.25,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,He shoots! He scores! That's 2-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.00,Default,Male Student B,0,0,0,,I wanna score a goal like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.50,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Hey, look. A girl from South Braxton High.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:30.31,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Their uniforms are sexy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:33.47,Default,Male Student B,0,0,0,,In what way? It's all black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:35.43,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,That's what's great about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.01,Default,Male Student A,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.38,Italics,Noel,0,0,0,,I like uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:43.13,Italics,Noel,0,0,0,,When I'm in uniform, I don't need \Nto prove who I am to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:08.92,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You fell for it, Noel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:13.67,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,That's my precious Osushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:17.72,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Today's the day I'm gonna see—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:20.73,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,...those panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:27.10,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,So you were finally able\Nto complete your sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:28.21,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:33.11,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Yeah. Your attention to detail is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.65,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I love that about you, too—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:39.84,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,C'mon, seriously! That was dangerous!\NThat would've actually hit anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:43.26,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,No, it wouldn't have. I threw it \Nwith no intention of hitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:50.96,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, Noel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:54.33,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,If you think you're dealing \Nwith the same ol' Balgo, you're—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:58.62,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,...completely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:05.85,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Why don't we find you a more suitable owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:20.36,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Noel Niihashi, reporting for duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:34.30,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Noel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.53,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,It's Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.14,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Ninny! Can I get your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:42.70,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:43.54,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:45.43,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:46.87,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Shake my hand, Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:47.64,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:06.99,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Hey, clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:08.75,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Come on. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:14.17,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You're late! A whole crowd \Nshowed up because of you, Niiha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.56,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Sorry. The usual gentleman \Nin Front London held me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:24.17,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Could it be that you were worried\Nand waited here for me, Ninny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:24.93,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:27.15,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,O-Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.32,Top,Rando,0,0,0,,Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.97,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Part of being an idol is—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:28.97,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:30.47,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.89,Default,Rando child,0,0,0,,Can I get a selfie with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:34.94,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,...giving fanservice to my fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.19,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:37.32,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Hey, Ninny—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.49,Top,Rando,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't I next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.53,Top Overlap,Rando,0,0,0,,Can I get a selfie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.49,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,We're taking a shortcut\N 'cause you were late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:40.84,Top,Ninny,0,0,0,,Wait, Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.87,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,And I keep telling you not \Nto call me by my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:47.31,Default,Rando,0,0,0,,Do I need to remind you\Nthat I have seniority?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:50.63,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Then will you start \Ncalling me "Noel," Ninny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:54.25,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I prefer my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.35,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Well, "Niiha" is cuter, so deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:04:00.01,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Not to mention, "Noel" is a guy's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.48,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,In Japan, it's a girl's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.26,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Didn't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:09.52,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Would you stop acting Japanese? \NYou've never even been to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.24,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:17.98,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:22.99,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.62,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Though we forced our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:28.28,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,It's fine. The important thing is we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:30.24,Default,Conductor,0,0,0,,Uh, if I could see your tickets, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:33.77,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You should be more grateful \Nfor your senior's kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.71,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.38,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Ninny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.46,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Stop calling me that!
