Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.53,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,So? Where are we going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.5\3c&H2C1862&\b1\fs20\fsp-0.6\c&H2C1862&\frz3.596\pos(504.666,142.001)}WB Pipers 2nd Umbrella
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\3c&H2C1862&\b1\fs20\fsp-0.6\c&HEFE1FC&\frz3.596\pos(506.667,139.334)}WB Pipers 2nd Umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.5\fscx90\c&H382366&\frz9.5\pos(532.667,314.667)}Ninny
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H66D0F9&\frz9.5\pos(535.333,311.334)}Ninny
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H382366&\frz9.5\pos(537.333,346)}Spangcole
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H66D0F9&\frz9.5\pos(539.999,342.667)}Spangcole
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:09.07,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,Ninebrook Pastures. It's a lot of fun there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:13.55,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,The other day, you said a place that \Nwas crawling with bugs was fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:16.89,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure your "fun" gauge is busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.72,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:21.45,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,I'm sure you would've had a blast \Nif you were a frog, Ninny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.78,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Well, that hypothetical is not the reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:30.16,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Let's get going. No matter how much you \Nyell about it, our destination won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.5\3c&H423A21&\b1\fs20\fsp-0.6\c&H423A21&\pos(114,151.333)\frz7.235}WB Pipers 1st Umbrella
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\3c&H423A21&\b1\fs20\fsp-0.6\c&HFEF2E0&\pos(116.001,148.666)\frz7.235}WB Pipers 1st Umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.5\fscx90\c&H332737&\pos(150,312)\frz5.747}Noel
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H8042DA&\pos(152.666,308.667)\frz5.747}Noel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H332737&\pos(154.666,343.333)\frz5.747}Niihashi
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fs46\fnArial Black\blur0.3\fscx90\c&H8042DA&\pos(157.332,340)\frz5.747}Niihashi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:37.91,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. Let's go get us\N some work experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.02,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.62,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Noel...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:07.94,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I wanna see... your panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.53,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Wait! What the hell was that flashback for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:13.78,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Well, you just said \NI imagined Noel disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.70,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Because you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:20.93,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,"She disappeared to Reverse London"?\N C'mon, dude, that's just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:24.06,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Most people stop believing in that\N before even Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:28.21,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Whatever. Let's just stop talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:31.36,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Now, let's start talking \Nabout Noel's panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.18,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,You're even more delusional now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.75,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,It's not a delusion. It's my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:38.73,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,There's no point in sugarcoating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:42.71,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,It's just wishful thinking.\N Wake up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.12,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.98,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Bark at him, Osushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:49.73,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,So cuh-yoooot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:52.28,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not the point here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:56.45,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Think about it, dude. You're failing here \N'cause you keep mentioning her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.98,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You mean you don't want to see panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.12,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,That's also not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:07.53,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to become \Nfriends with her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:12.97,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I'm having a hard time because \NI haven't been able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.97,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Well, I only met her for, \Nlike, a second last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:20.56,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Let's all go see her next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.53,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You're after her, too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:24.49,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.34,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You're after her, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.36,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,N-o-e-l!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:33.64,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not! I'm trying to help out \Nthe buddy I've known since I was a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:38.89,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,But I mean, if she happens to \Nhave a cute friend or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:41.33,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,she could introduce me, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:46.21,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I knew it. I figured you \Nhad some ulterior motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:49.08,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I saved your life, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:54.34,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,If I hadn't saved you back when we were \Nseven, you wouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.93,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Man, that really hurt back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.14,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Talk about the boonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:19.37,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I think it's lovely here. It's very peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.06,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Nope, nope, nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:28.05,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I wanna hurry up and climb the ladder, join \Nthe Sabres, and protect the city of London!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.44,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Don't you feel the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.68,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I'm fine with how things are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.30,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,This suits me quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.96,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:40.18,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Are you the witches from Wing Bind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:43.88,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.\N I'm 1st Umbrella Niihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.73,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,This is 2nd Umbrella Spangcole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:50.06,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Uh, hello? Don't introduce me\N like I'm your junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:53.27,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a couple \Nof adorable witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:57.55,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Sorry this is so sudden, but I'd like \Nsome help with a Rank-A harvest today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.88,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,In Japan, don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.91,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,kill all dragons, no questions asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.91,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess this is less barbaric, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:10.31,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know. I was born in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:13.80,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Why don't you know?! \NAct Japanese for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.34,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,But what I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:22.37,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,there's no reason we should have to go \Nthrough this... just to get some grapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.76,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,for some damn champagne!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.60,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:29.48,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,If a civilian were to\Ntouch a dragon directly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.61,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Worst case, they'd get the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.68,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,When dragons make contact with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:39.44,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,they absorb all of their negative emotions,\N and turn into dark dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:45.72,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,We witches exist to be a bridge \Nbetween humans and dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.87,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Please stop yapping and \Njust hurry up and climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:52.32,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Where do you get off talking \Nto your senior like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:55.37,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,And how the heck are you not out of breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.51,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That reeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:06.33,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Where the heck are these grapes \Nsupposed to be, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.19,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Inside their nostrils.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.19,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Seriously? This is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.31,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I wanna get promoted already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:18.53,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:22.07,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Well? Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:25.08,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:31.66,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I could've sworn she went \Ninto this telephone booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:34.54,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, you dreamed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.08,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Or rather, it was a delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.12,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:43.80,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,When I came to, this thing had been replaced\N by a manhole or something with "WB" on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.10,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,"WB"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:46.91,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.85,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,If it was Reverse London,\N it should've been "RL."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:57.48,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.41,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,It's almost time to feed Osushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:04.85,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,It suits you way more to just be\N in a daze thinking about panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.49,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Y-You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:10.58,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I'm still thinking about panties \Neven at this very moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:26.55,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.37,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Osushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:37.30,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,O-Osushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.35,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Your ringtone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:53.65,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That's the {\i1}Dragon Ball{\i0} recap music!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:55.50,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You're totally acting Japanese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.27,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Hello. Niihashi here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:59.17,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness you answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:01.88,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.16,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,Could you wrap up that harvest job \Nand do an extermination job instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:10.09,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,No. I'm hanging up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:13.25,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,You're joking, right? Don't hang up!\N At least let me explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.43,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:17.74,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Chief must be half asleep. \NHe's asking us to do an extermination job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.49,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.15,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:26.57,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,You see, the Sabres are up north \Nfor a practice exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:30.21,Italics,Noel,0,0,0,,So why does that mean we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.68,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You already know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:36.58,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,It's because we're the \Nstrongest Pipers out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:41.17,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,The location is South Braxton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:44.49,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Noel, you have a coin that \Ngoes directly there, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:46.17,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Niiha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:49.92,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,We don't have time to get there with\N a phonegate! Let's use the coingate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.12,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,You seem awfully happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.68,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.31,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,This is my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.24,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,We're gonna save London, \Nmake everyone take notice of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:00.94,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna be promoted to the Sabres!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:16.75,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:18.75,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.57,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Something's there! \NSomething's there, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.34,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,There sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:26.99,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I can't see it, but it's definitely nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.96,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,H-Hang in there, Osushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:32.10,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.16,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,It's coming! It's coming! It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:45.83,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,There it is! The dark dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:49.71,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,We were able to appear right \Nwhere the sensor indicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.24,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Of course we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.81,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,But what the heck is this thing \Ndoing in Front London?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.01,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,It is quite strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:15:01.26,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,How did it conceal itself until \Nit was able to get this large?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.21,Default,Osushi Dragon,0,0,0,,Noel...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:08.72,Default,Osushi Dragon,0,0,0,,Let me see... your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:11.21,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.78,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.56,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,It said your name, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.85,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Balgo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:21.06,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I know you're there, Balgo! Get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:23.37,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Yup, you sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:24.61,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:27.28,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,N-N-Noel is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.55,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,She's flying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:33.49,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Contact with a dragon carries \Na 100-year sentence. Or worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.00,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,The death penalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:39.54,Top,Osushi Dragon,0,0,0,,Let me see... your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.54,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Sh-She's super mad for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:43.00,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Oh, man! Her angry face is super cute, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:47.34,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. So this is the Front London\N guy you keep talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.39,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I will obey the rules and kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.05,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Now, hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:56.42,Top,Osushi Dragon,0,0,0,,Let me see... your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.74,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Does that lump of fur \Nhe's carrying look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.64,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I think it's Osushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.00,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,What's with the super-Japanese name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:04.44,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,It's a puppy Balgo found. \NHe was very fond of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:07.52,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Must be a Disguiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.39,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I've never heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:12.73,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,They're dragons that use corpses as a \Ndisguise and become what the body is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.83,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,They were everywhere \Nuntil about the 18th century,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:19.88,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,but they cleaned up the city and\N their numbers went down, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:23.54,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Hey! Noel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:28.00,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,How can you act like that\N when Osushi just died?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:32.00,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Osushi's not dead! \NHe's just a bit limper, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:37.55,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,He's not limper, he's totally flat! \NThat dragon chewed him open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:41.44,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Dragon? Can you actually see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.06,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Safety first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.55,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,First, I'm gonna take those two in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:48.65,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Niiha, you take care of the dark dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.96,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Will Balgo get the death penalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.34,Default,Niiha,0,0,0,,We don't get to decide that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:03.96,Top,Osushi Dragon,0,0,0,,Let me see... your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.96,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,It's all right now. Just follow \Nmy directions and get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:08.79,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Wait, Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:17.93,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.75,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Osushi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.84,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:34.15,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. And I was so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:37.90,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,I was planning to kill you all\N by ripping you apart, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:41.28,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Huh? Selby?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:46.54,Default,Selby,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Balgo? \NDo I still look like Selby to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.54,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,"Look like"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.80,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I can only hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:53.53,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get out of here, Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.80,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,It's not like I want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:18:00.05,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,I just want to eat a witch \Nso I can become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.31,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's just a superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:07.56,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Well, I won't know if it's a \Nsuperstition or not until I eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.62,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,A bit late on the support there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:19.03,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I took care of the other thing, \Nso I'd say I was pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.66,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,So, two Disguisers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.01,0:18:26.33,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Who's the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:29.55,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Selby. He's Balgo's childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:33.34,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,When they were seven, \Nthey were both almost hit by a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:37.09,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Apparently, Selby tried to protect \NBalgo and was badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:39.05,Flashback,Rescue Worker,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.45,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,That must've been when it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:47.68,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,A dragon that's been in the city and \Ninteracting with humans for that long...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:50.10,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Bet you've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:18:59.24,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Ninny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:20.57,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay, Noel's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.75,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:30.23,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Stop asking someone covered in blood \Nstupid questions like, "Are you okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:32.07,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,and get the heck outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:35.82,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. It's just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:37.92,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I couldn't just abandon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.40,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Well, you should have...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:43.91,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:50.16,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:51.66,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:54.42,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Once I've eaten her and become immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:58.25,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,I'm willing to let Niihashi go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.91,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:26.82,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Whoa! Your face is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.98,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You moron! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.04,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You love Niiha, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.94,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,What? You call Noel "Niiha"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:36.38,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Wow, that's new and kinda exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:39.53,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,You're only feeling "excited" \N'cause you're losing a lot of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.07,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, Balgo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:45.18,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Did you fall for this chick, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.79,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're gonna \Nhave to give up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:48.95,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:52.85,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,The one I can't abandon is you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:53.82,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Selby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.26,0:20:57.23,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:21:00.36,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Selby died protecting you\N when he was seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:04.92,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,I just wore Selby's corpse and \Nacted like him this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:09.32,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,So you traded places with him back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:13.69,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,But after that, it's been you the \Nwhole time, right? In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:17.75,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You've been Selby way \Nlonger than the real Selby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:23.62,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I might just be dense, \Nbut you were always kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:27.52,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I've always thought of you\N as my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:33.10,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to abandon you when \Nyou're saying you're gonna eat someone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.99,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:39.11,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,If you can't understand what I'm saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:40.27,Default,Selby Dragon,0,0,0,,then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.51,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,N-Noel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.45,0:22:02.50,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.18,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:05.53,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:09.26,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,You were actually slightly cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:30.20,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I accept your feelings, Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:42.00,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Absolute Dragon Shatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:00.49,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:02.47,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:08.40,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Wasn't this building up to him being\N spared because you were so moved?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.54,0:23:12.01,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Was it? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:13.91,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Okay, that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.25,0:23:18.41,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,We kill dark dragons. Those are the rules.\N And our work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:20.03,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:26.21,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:32.39,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:34.59,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:40.23,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,Well, you know how Balgo was in \Ncontact with a dragon for ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:44.77,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,On top of that, he got bitten, \Nso he turned into a dragonclad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.94,0:23:49.71,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,So what?! I don't know what \Na dragonclad or whatever is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:52.66,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,but shouldn't he be \Ngetting the death penalty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:54.01,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:24:00.17,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,Dragonclads are essentially dragons, \Nso we have to treat them as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:05.43,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,And so, we're going to \Nbe keeping Balgo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.21,Default,Billy,0,0,0,,So good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:14.11,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait a minute, Billy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:15.22,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Listen here...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:17.53,Default,Osushi,0,0,0,,Noel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:18.14,Top,Ninny,0,0,0,,He's so fast! Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.28,0:24:19.93,Default,Osushi,0,0,0,,Let me see your panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:24.56,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Well, uh, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:28.32,Default,Osushi,0,0,0,,Noel, let me see your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:30.53,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,I swear he just learned that on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:33.50,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,But y'know, we should be \Nfocusing on how amazing Osushi is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:38.20,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,instead of the words he keeps saying! \NThey're really not that deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.31,0:26:33.92,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Line up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.79,0:26:38.67,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to give you all some.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.87,0:26:48.55,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Thanks, Wordsworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.06,0:27:01.13,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You're still as cute as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.13,0:27:05.04,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,You'll get the Nobel Prize for\N Cuteness ten years in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.93,0:27:11.03,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Don't lick both... my nose and mouth... \Nat once... I can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.43,0:27:18.64,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Balgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.64,0:27:20.45,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am! You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.67,0:27:22.20,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Could you answer this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:28.91,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, it's Ninny! \NShould I really be answering this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.57,0:27:34.17,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,Hell—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.17,0:27:35.50,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Niiha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:40.73,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Why the heck are you on today's \NWing Bind Head Liners and I'm not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:44.54,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,I definitely did most of the work!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:48.77,Italics,Balgo,0,0,0,,U-Um... I'm sorry. \NI have no idea what you're talking about—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.77,0:27:52.48,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Hey! Why the heck are you \Nanswering Niiha's phone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.48,0:27:53.78,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,No idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:58.78,Italics,Ninny,0,0,0,,Do you think you're super close now \Njust because it's her week to look after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.78,0:28:00.37,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:04.07,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Only I'm allowed to answer \NNiiha's phone without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.49,0:28:08.06,Default,Balgo,0,0,0,,It seems like she's mad at me\N now for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:10.14,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,That's why I had you answer my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:13.83,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,Also, no one's allowed to answer \Nmy phone without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.58,0:28:22.32,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,Ninny, Noel, you around? It's your chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.75,0:28:26.57,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,There's an emergency, so I was \Nhoping you could head to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:29.97,Default,Noel,0,0,0,,No. It's Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:34.23,Default,Ninny,0,0,0,,Are you stupid? \NI'm gonna hop in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.23,0:28:39.05,Italics,Billy,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad. This job was worth \Nfive times the pay and points, too.
